{"id":"the-deets-on-the-ice","path":"/the-deets-on-the-ice/","title":"Info on the ice - Minnesnowii Shave Ice","description":"Blog, Front Page bar mitzvah, bat mitzvah, birthday parties, catering services, corporate food truck catering, food truck, Food truck catering Minneapolis, food truck catering mn, food truck fund raising, google catering, graduation party catering, Minnesnowii, minnesota, minnesota state fair, mn, shave ice, shaved ice","robots":"index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1","ogTitle":"Info on the ice","ogDescription":"Blog, Front Page bar mitzvah, bat mitzvah, birthday parties, catering services, corporate food truck catering, food truck, Food truck catering Minneapolis, food truck catering mn, food truck fund raising, google catering, graduation party catering, Minnesnowii, minnesota, minnesota state fair, mn, shave ice, shaved ice","ogImage":"https://minnesnowii.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/IMG_5777.jpg","twitterCard":"summary_large_image","jsonLdCount":1,"text":"BOOK US TODAY!  (952) 486-0079\nPrimary Menu\nSkip to content\nJobs\nBlog\nFun With Shave Ice\nEvent and Party Catering\nIn The News\n\n  February 25, 2023  |    Leave a comment\n\nIf you’re looking for a refreshing and tasty treat to beat the heat, look no further than Hawaiian shave ice. Also known as shave ice or simply “shaved ice,” this delicious dessert has been a favorite in Hawaii for generations, and for good reason.\n\nWhat is Hawaiian Shave Ice?\n\nHawaiian shave ice is a dessert made from a finely shaved block of ice, which is then flavored with fresh fruit pureed flavors mixed with pure cane sugar. Unlike traditional snow cones, which use coarser ice that can be crunchy and hard to eat, Shave ice is light and fluffy, almost like fresh snow. This texture allows the syrup to be absorbed evenly, resulting in a refreshing and flavorful treat that is perfect for hot summer days.\n\nHow is Hawaiian Shave Ice made?\n\nShave ice is made using a commercial block ice shaver, which shaves ice into very fine pieces. These pieces are then packed tightly into a cup and drizzled with one or more of the many delicious syrup flavors available.\n\nTraditionally, Hawaiian shave ice is served with a scoop of vanilla ice cream in the cup, and toppings such as sweetened condensed milk, mochi, or fresh fruit can also be added for an extra burst of flavor and texture.\n\nWhat are the most popular flavors of Hawaiian Shave Ice?\n\nOne of the best things about shave ice is the wide variety of flavors available. From classic flavors like cherry, grape, and blue raspberry to more exotic options like lychee, guava, and passion fruit, there is a flavor to suit every taste.\n\nShave ice is a delicious and refreshing dessert that is perfect for hot summer days. With its light, fluffy texture and wide variety of flavors and toppings, it’s no wonder that this dessert has been a favorite in Hawaii for generations. So next time you’re looking for a sweet treat to cool you down, be sure to give us a try!\n\n \n\nhttp://minnesnowii.com\n\n  Blog   bar mitzvah, bat mitzvah, birthday parties, catering services, corporate food truck catering, food truck, Food truck catering Minneapolis, food truck catering mn, food truck fund raising, google catering, graduation party catering, Minnesnowii, minnesota, minnesota state fair, mn, shave ice, shaved ice\nLeave a Reply\n\nYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *\n\nName *\n\nEmail *\n\nWebsite\n\n Save my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment.\n\nDAYS\n0\n0\n0\nHOURS\n0\n0\nMINUTES\n0\n0\nSECONDS\n0\n0\nJoin us at the MN State Fair!\n\n\nAcross from the GIANT SLIDE!\n\n\n\n6100 Mccoll Dr Unit 381\nSavage MN\nBook Us Today!\n(952) 486-0079\n  \nEvent and Party Catering\nFun With Shave Ice\nIn The Media\nBlog\nJobs\nRochester\nHome\n\n\n\n© 2026 Minnesnowii. All rights reserved. Favicon by Flaticon. Site design by Stargazer LLC.","li